DECLARE `s 49 JSA 6D(3) action` IS ONE OF
    `s 49 JSA 6D(3)(a) carrying out work searches`
    `s 49 JSA 6D(3)(b) making applications`
    `s 49 JSA 6D(3)(c) creating and maintaining an online profile`
