DECLARE `s 49 JSA 6 limitation` IS ONE OF
    `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(a) work of a particular nature`
    `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(b) work with a particular level of remuneration`
    `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(c) work in particular locations`
    `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(d) work available for a certain number of hours per week or at particular times`
