-- src:740 | (5) A limitation under subsection (4) may in particular be by reference to—
-- src:741 | (a) work of a particular nature,
-- src:742 | (b) work with a particular level of remuneration,
-- src:743 | (c) work in particular locations, or
-- src:744 | (d) work available for a certain number of hours per week or at particular times,
