GIVEN `the limitation` IS A `s 49 JSA 6 limitation`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 49 JSA 6D(5) the limitation under subsection (4) may be by reference to that` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the limitation`
    WHEN `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(a) work of a particular nature` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(b) work with a particular level of remuneration` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(c) work in particular locations` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 49 JSA 6D(5)(d) work available for a certain number of hours per week or at particular times` THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "A limitation ... may in particular be by reference to" four things and does not close the list
